1314
00:45:03,508 --> 00:45:05,477
He's such a genius to do this in just four hours.

1315
00:45:05,478 --> 00:45:06,538
Of course.

1316
00:45:07,348 --> 00:45:10,647
And you look ten years younger, Seok Jin.

1317
00:45:10,648 --> 00:45:13,278
