1318
00:45:16,788 --> 00:45:19,457
I can tell it was done half-heartedly.

1319
00:45:19,458 --> 00:45:20,527
It's obvious.

1320
00:45:20,528 --> 00:45:22,657
- No.
- It's obvious.

1321
00:45:22,658 --> 00:45:23,727
