- Me.

1364
00:46:59,088 --> 00:47:00,557
- I'm talking about the music video.
- Okay.

1365
00:47:00,558 --> 00:47:02,118
- I played a global celebrity.
- I see.

1366
00:47:02,558 --> 00:47:04,628
