1377
00:47:26,818 --> 00:47:28,618
- But...
- It's a work of a genius director.

1378
00:47:29,118 --> 00:47:30,688
Watch this.

1379
00:47:31,288 --> 00:47:33,558
I landed in Hong Kong.

1380
