1409
00:48:40,928 --> 00:48:43,287
- Isn't this good?
- That's good.

1410
00:48:43,288 --> 00:48:44,827
- This is good, right?
- Very nice.

1411
00:48:44,828 --> 00:48:46,328
- This scene is good.
- Yes.

1412
00:48:47,328 --> 00:48:51,597
