1413
00:48:51,598 --> 00:48:53,398
That's called corny acting.

1414
00:48:54,108 --> 00:48:56,237
You keep stopping like this.

1415
00:48:56,238 --> 00:48:57,377
That's terrible.

1416
00:48:57,378 --> 00:48:58,778
You need to turn your head at once.

1417
00:48:58,908 --> 00:49:00,977
(Stiff)

1418
00:49:00,978 --> 00:49:03,377
That's awful acting.

1419
00:49:03,378 --> 00:49:06,048
If you felt something,

1420
00:49:06,148 --> 00:49:08,048
- you need to turn smoothly. But...
- I see.

1421
00:49:09,688 --> 00:49:10,688
That's how you turned.

1422
00:49:12,618 --> 00:49:13,688
That's how you turned.

1423
00:49:16,128 --> 00:49:17,697
That's awful acting.

1424
00:49:17,698 --> 00:49:19,598
Corny? How can he say that?

1425
00:49:20,458 --> 00:49:23,467
He's supposed to look after me today,

1426
00:49:23,468 --> 00:49:24,637
but he called me corny.

1427
00:49:24,638 --> 00:49:26,897
I think they're corny secretaries.

1428
00:49:26,898 --> 00:49:28,268
(Holding grudges)

1429
00:49:29,068 --> 00:49:31,638
(He's never seen secretaries like them before.)

1430
00:49:31,708 --> 00:49:33,777
That's awful acting.

1431
00:49:33,778 --> 00:49:34,907
(Seo Jin is firm because it's his field of expertise.)

1432
00:49:34,908 --> 00:49:37,108
Hey. Can't you just be nice and compliment him?

1433
00:49:37,248 --> 00:49:38,778
But there's nothing to compliment.

1434
