1441
00:49:54,368 --> 00:49:55,527
I never say what's not true.

1442
00:49:55,528 --> 00:49:56,568
Yes.

1443
00:49:57,068 --> 00:49:58,068
To be honest,

1444
00:49:58,069 --> 00:50:00,067
when he showed it to me in the past,

1445
00:50:00,068 --> 00:50:02,738
I pretended to be impressed.

1446
00:50:03,068 --> 00:50:05,077
It was so satisfying to hear what he said.

1447
00:50:05,078 --> 00:50:06,714
(It was so satisfying to hear what Seo Jin said.)

1448
00:50:06,738 --> 00:50:09,308
(I'm alone here.)

1449
00:50:09,378 --> 00:50:11,317
Hey, why are you belittling my brother?

1450
00:50:11,318 --> 00:50:12,347
That was ten years ago.

1451
00:50:12,348 --> 00:50:13,817
- Right.
- You'd do better...

1452
00:50:13,818 --> 00:50:15,247
