- It's a big stage.

1479
00:51:03,198 --> 00:51:04,297
- It's huge.
- Why is it so big?

1480
00:51:04,298 --> 00:51:05,437
(Unexpected level)

1481
00:51:05,438 --> 00:51:09,107
- That wasn't what I expected.
- That wasn't what I expected.

1482
00:51:09,108 --> 00:51:10,468
- That's what I mean.
- It's huge.

1483
00:51:11,938 --> 00:51:16,048
