- Isaac Hong.

1485
00:51:20,718 --> 00:51:22,687
- Isaac Hong.
- He was on "Sing Again."

1486
00:51:22,688 --> 00:51:24,887
- He's the winner of "Sing Again 3."
- He won.

1487
00:51:24,888 --> 00:51:25,987
I think I know who that is.

1488
00:51:25,988 --> 00:51:28,087
