1510
00:52:10,868 --> 00:52:13,867
Jee Seok Jin and Ji Ye Eun formed a group.

1511
00:52:13,868 --> 00:52:15,467
- That's CHOONGJU JI-C?
- Yes.

1512
00:52:15,468 --> 00:52:17,237
