1523
00:52:41,068 --> 00:52:43,027
- We even had the autograph event.
- Seriously.

1524
00:52:43,028 --> 00:52:44,838
We've been together for five hours.

1525
00:52:45,768 --> 00:52:48,307
More than five hours. We spent almost half a day together.

1526
00:52:48,308 --> 00:52:49,537
Seriously.

1527
00:52:49,538 --> 00:52:50,538
No.

1528
00:52:50,908 --> 00:52:52,777
I didn't expect you to name the group after that.

1529
00:52:52,778 --> 00:52:54,407
You need to pay attention.

1530
00:52:54,408 --> 00:52:56,207
I thought the name of the group would be something else.

