2279
01:21:09,414 --> 01:21:11,013
"Milk Shake!"

2280
01:21:11,014 --> 01:21:12,924
"Milk Shake!"

2281
01:21:13,124 --> 01:21:14,923
- "AQUA!"
- "AQUA!"

2282
01:21:14,924 --> 01:21:16,123
- "AQUA!"
- "AQUA!"

2283
01:21:16,124 --> 01:21:17,254
They know our songs?

2284
01:21:18,424 --> 01:21:19,494
They do?

2285
01:21:19,824 --> 01:21:21,223
